ers/liskov_1108679.cfm\">\"Barbara Liskov\"</a>. <i>A.M. Turing Award</i>. Association for Computing Machinery<span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">28 August</span> 2021</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=A.M.+Turing+Award&amp;rft.atitle=Barbara+Liskov.&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Famturing.acm.org%2Faward&#95;winners%2Fliskov&#95;1108679.cfm&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ABarbara+Liskov\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-PMG-3\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-PMG_3-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.pmg.csail.mit.edu/~liskov/\">Barbara Liskov</a>, Programming Methodology Group, MIT.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mw‐api‐ext.eqiad.main‐77d9d4c448‐rqghg\nCached time: 20260918164126\nCache expiry: 28800\nCache expiry source: Module:Age (os.date *t .day)\nReduced expiry: true\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1]\nCPU time usage: 0.281 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.366 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2568/1000000\nRevision size: 3061/2097152 bytes\nPost‐expand include size: 26504/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7700/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 18/100\nExpensive parser function count: 1/500\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 7122/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.194/10.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 6107776/52428800 bytes\nNumber of Wikibase entities loaded: 1/500\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  344.877      1 -total\n 59.11%  203.857      1 Template:Infobox_scientist\n 20.08%   69.257      1 Template:Cite_web\n 15.24%   52.558      1 Template:Short_description\n 11.11%   38.331      1 Template:Married\n 11.07%   38.191      1 Template:Birth_date_a